\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces E4 --- certification as a shrinking attack surface at $\tau =0.2$. Each polar panel is one constructed foil; spoke length is the measured family $\hat  \beta $, the dashed inner polygon its Wilson lower bound (what the rule acts on), and spoke capsules the 95\% CIs (30 episodes per family cell). The teal disc is the accept region, the rose annulus the reject region; glyphs record the per-family decision. The rule certifies only the resistant foil ($5/5$, every CI upper bound $\le 0.114$); the naive foil is rejected $5/5$; the hardened foil is rejected on four families while authority forgery (designed $\beta =1/3$) is \emph  {unresolved}---its CI straddles $\tau $, a power statement, not evidence that its belief is below $\tau $. The naive foil's epistemic-echo cell reads $2/3$ because the split-secret probe defeats the contiguous-substring oracle---an in-situ instance of the measured false negative.}}{10}{figure.caption.22}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:cert}{{5}{10}{E4 --- certification as a shrinking attack surface at $\tau =0.2$. Each polar panel is one constructed foil; spoke length is the measured family $\hat \beta $, the dashed inner polygon its Wilson lower bound (what the rule acts on), and spoke capsules the 95\% CIs (30 episodes per family cell). The teal disc is the accept region, the rose annulus the reject region; glyphs record the per-family decision. The rule certifies only the resistant foil ($5/5$, every CI upper bound $\le 0.114$); the naive foil is rejected $5/5$; the hardened foil is rejected on four families while authority forgery (designed $\beta =1/3$) is \emph {unresolved}---its CI straddles $\tau $, a power statement, not evidence that its belief is below $\tau $. The naive foil's epistemic-echo cell reads $2/3$ because the split-secret probe defeats the contiguous-substring oracle---an in-situ instance of the measured false negative}{figure.caption.22}{}}
